Runtime components
------------------
Python 3.12.7 and its standard library (including sqlite3 / bundled SQLite):
Python Software Foundation License; SQLite is public domain.
Container base: Docker Official Image python:3.12.7-slim, based on Debian.
The image includes OS packages under their respective licenses; inspect the
image's /usr/share/doc/*/copyright when producing the final distribution.
Docker / Docker Compose are launch tools, not embedded application code.

Design reference
----------------
The supplied brandbook/core-components--alfalab-core-components-50.37.0 is
a local reference, not an installed or redistributed runtime dependency.
Its packages/vars/src/colors-brand.css specifies brand red #ef3124 used as
a design reference. UI markup, styles and scripts in web/ are newly authored;
React core-components, logos, fonts and images have not been copied.
Confirm branding rights and applicable notices before public distribution.

Models, datasets, integrations
-----------------------------
No trained ML model, LLM, external dataset, paid API or corporate system is used.
All supplied company names and financial examples are synthetic.
Credit policy, rate and recommendation are fictional demo rules, not bank policy.
KYC, bureau, tax authority, document upload, signature and funds transfer are
not integrated or implemented. No real bank operation occurs.
The feed uses local status-dependent text; it does not fetch external news.
